  "account": "赵健的读书日记",
  "source_title": "诸君，一家八口人蜗居在香港50平的出租屋，你想过这样的生活吗，今天中秋节带我儿子去上幼儿园，发现全校每个孩子都穿着中式传统服装，我们逛了维多利亚公园的彩灯，还赶上了铜锣湾的舞火龙，祝福每一个看到火龙的朋友，一切顺顺利利！#中秋节 #香港 #铜锣湾 #非遗",
  "title_is_metadata_not_transcript": true,
  "input_mode": "text_only",
  "status": "AI_PENDING",
  "unit_index": 1,
  "unit_count": 1,
  "all_video_unit_ids": [
    "v_4e5ac4f844cfdd7a_u01"
  ],
  "duration_s": 300.280998,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "朱军一家八口人蜗居在香港五十平的出租里，你想过这样的生活吗？你看香港的房子再小，都会设计一个保姆，间上铺是床，下铺是收纳的柜子，还有他独立的洗澡、卫生间和洗衣机。菲佣的每个月四千多块钱，工资其实并不算高，和我们相处很负责任，也很有边界感。今天，中秋节带我儿子去上幼儿园，发现全校每个孩子都穿着中式传统服装，特别重视小朋友们手里还都拎着自己做的花灯，还会给邻居和物业派发月饼礼物。带我儿子逛了一下维多利亚公园的彩灯，黄大仙子的莺歌舞，我们还赶上了铜锣湾的五火龙，长长的火龙在人群中翻香龙身插了几千根。檀香仪式结束后会把这些香火分发给路人游客，诸君祝福每一个看到火龙的你，一切顺顺利利。今年中秋节，我们家很热，电脑，安娜、爷爷奶奶、姥姥姥爷都在，再加上保姆阿姨和我家的黑猫警长阿sir全家八口人加一只猫挤在一起，其乐融融。这只猫是五年前在路边捡来的，现在成了我们的家人。阿瑟很快适应了香港的生活。我老婆是西安人我是淮安人，所以我儿子叫安安，现在他叫铜锣湾安仔嘟图姐快呀。猫咪为什么想到带孩子来香港上学？其实我并不是想让我儿子接受香港本地的DSE考试和华侨生联考，我特别认可一众将IB的教育体系。而中国实行IB学校最多的城市就是香港，而且这是全球最难的一种课程体系，对孩子的挑战会非常大，他要比内地的高考要比level AP、 DSE等等都要更难。不仅要求会考试，还要学会独立做研究、写长论文。而且IB教育很强调尊重差异，主动与别人合作，多数人追求的根本就不是幸福，而是高人一等的优越感。我很认可IB这种很善良的教育观。我希望我的孩子他会主动阅读，会批判性思考，勇于表达、尊重这个丰富的世界。人成长的过程就是在逐渐减少偏见。目前内地在幼儿园和小学阶段就开始实行IB教育的很少。其实上海和北京的IB中学也很好。我之所以没有在香港买房，就是想着以后也许随着我儿子上中学，我们还会继续搬家。我不在任何城市下注，不在任何地点抱有定居思维，也不和任何人或物绑定，随时随地拥有绝对的迁徙。权要知道，这几年，我为了寻找IB学校，专门考察过加拿大、芬兰、德国、美国、新西兰等等很多国家，但最终还是选择回到中国香港，很国际化，但他永远是我们中国的香港。这是一个可进可退的、很现实的城市选择，我对其他国家真的实在没有归属感。你要让我去国外旅游，但我非常开心，但真要让我长期住在那里，想想都很孤独。我看到很多国外的陪读，父母表面看起来物质生活很丰富，但是内心都异常痛苦。因为你知道你很难融入当地的主流生活，而为什么做游客的时候总是快乐的？因为你知道你的痛苦和责任都不在这里，置身事外，才能感受到幸福。爸爸，你这样好好嗯，好吃吗？是嗯这么大，你吃这么多，慢点吃，我期待安安在香港成长，经常跟着我往返。香港和北京既有中国灵魂，又有世界胸怀。香港人特别爱国，街头处处挂着国旗。在香港，我最喜欢的就是自己在家做油泼面吃。你看香港这么发达，怎么还是给人一种九十年代的感觉。其实内地普通人的生活便利性是遥遥领先的。每一个在香港打拼的内地朋友都各有心算。我很佩服每一个能出去单打独斗的人，敢想敢拼敢干，一个人就能活出一个队伍。你可以回头看，但不能往回走。朱军，你知道吗？我儿子到维多利亚港只要二十分钟，但我这一路走了三十多年，而你相信吗？你莫名向往的那个陌生的城市，都是今生有羁绊的地方。那种心底的拉扯从不是偶然，而是上天在指引你去完成未尽的缘分。那里或许有你要重逢的人，又或许有属于你的机会。当你站在那片土地上时，你才会明白，所有的奔赴都是命中注定的。久别重逢，祝福你，别再过你应该过的人生。去过你想过的人生。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4e5ac4f844cfdd7a_s00001",
      "start_ms": 320,
      "end_ms": 4480,
      "text": "朱军一家八口人蜗居在香港五十平的出租里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4e5ac4f844cfdd7a_s00002",
      "start_ms": 4700,
      "end_ms": 6100,
      "text": "你想过这样的生活吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4e5ac4f844cfdd7a_s00003",
      "start_ms": 6180,
      "end_ms": 7720,
      "text": "你看香港的房子再小，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4e5ac4f844cfdd7a_s00004",
      "start_ms": 7720,
      "end_ms": 8780,
      "text": "都会设计一个保姆，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4e5ac4f844cfdd7a_s00005",
      "start_ms": 8780,
      "end_ms": 10400,
      "text": "间上铺是床，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4e5ac4f844cfdd7a_s00006",
      "start_ms": 10720,
      "end_ms": 12440,
      "text": "下铺是收纳的柜子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4e5ac4f844cfdd7a_s00007",
      "start_ms": 12740,
      "end_ms": 15600,
      "text": "还有他独立的洗澡、卫生间和洗衣机。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4e5ac4f844cfdd7a_s00008",
      "start_ms": 16240,
      "end_ms": 17960,
      "text": "菲佣的每个月四千多块钱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4e5ac4f844cfdd7a_s00009",
      "start_ms": 17960,
      "end_ms": 19500,
      "text": "工资其实并不算高，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4e5ac4f844cfdd7a_s00010",
      "start_ms": 19900,
      "end_ms": 21420,
      "text": "和我们相处很负责任，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4e5ac4f844cfdd7a_s00011",
      "start_ms": 21520,
      "end_ms": 22480,
      "text": "也很有边界感。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4e5ac4f844cfdd7a_s00012",
      "start_ms": 22960,
      "end_ms": 23340,
      "text": "今天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4e5ac4f844cfdd7a_s00013",
      "start_ms": 23340,
      "end_ms": 25540,
      "text": "中秋节带我儿子去上幼儿园，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4e5ac4f844cfdd7a_s00014",
      "start_ms": 25960,
      "end_ms": 29020,
      "text": "发现全校每个孩子都穿着中式传统服装，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4e5ac4f844cfdd7a_s00015",
      "start_ms": 29260,
      "end_ms": 33050,
      "text": "特别重视小朋友们手里还都拎着自己做的花灯，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4e5ac4f844cfdd7a_s00016",
      "start_ms": 33550,
      "end_ms": 36290,
      "text": "还会给邻居和物业派发月饼礼物。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4e5ac4f844cfdd7a_s00017",
      "start_ms": 36930,
      "end_ms": 39390,
      "text": "带我儿子逛了一下维多利亚公园的彩灯，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4e5ac4f844cfdd7a_s00018",
      "start_ms": 39810,
      "end_ms": 41430,
      "text": "黄大仙子的莺歌舞，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4e5ac4f844cfdd7a_s00019",
      "start_ms": 41650,
      "end_ms": 43830,
      "text": "我们还赶上了铜锣湾的五火龙，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4e5ac4f844cfdd7a_s00020",
      "start_ms": 44450,
      "end_ms": 48670,
      "text": "长长的火龙在人群中翻香龙身插了几千根。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4e5ac4f844cfdd7a_s00021",
      "start_ms": 48670,
      "end_ms": 53210,
      "text": "檀香仪式结束后会把这些香火分发给路人游客，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4e5ac4f844cfdd7a_s00022",
      "start_ms": 53850,
      "end_ms": 56510,
      "text": "诸君祝福每一个看到火龙的你，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4e5ac4f844cfdd7a_s00023",
      "start_ms": 56690,
      "end_ms": 58070,
      "text": "一切顺顺利利。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4e5ac4f844cfdd7a_s00024",
      "start_ms": 58510,
      "end_ms": 59450,
      "text": "今年中秋节，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4e5ac4f844cfdd7a_s00025",
      "start_ms": 59470,
      "end_ms": 60200,
      "text": "我们家很热，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4e5ac4f844cfdd7a_s00026",
      "start_ms": 60240,
      "end_ms": 60540,
      "text": "电脑，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4e5ac4f844cfdd7a_s00027",
      "start_ms": 61020,
      "end_ms": 63395,
      "text": "安娜、爷爷奶奶、姥姥姥爷都在，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4e5ac4f844cfdd7a_s00028",
      "start_ms": 63760,
      "end_ms": 70130,
      "text": "再加上保姆阿姨和我家的黑猫警长阿sir全家八口人加一只猫挤在一起，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4e5ac4f844cfdd7a_s00029",
      "start_ms": 70250,
      "end_ms": 71095,
      "text": "其乐融融。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4e5ac4f844cfdd7a_s00030",
      "start_ms": 71750,
      "end_ms": 73995,
      "text": "这只猫是五年前在路边捡来的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4e5ac4f844cfdd7a_s00031",
      "start_ms": 74300,
      "end_ms": 75935,
      "text": "现在成了我们的家人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4e5ac4f844cfdd7a_s00032",
      "start_ms": 76480,
      "end_ms": 78395,
      "text": "阿瑟很快适应了香港的生活。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4e5ac4f844cfdd7a_s00033",
      "start_ms": 78910,
      "end_ms": 81545,
      "text": "我老婆是西安人我是淮安人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4e5ac4f844cfdd7a_s00034",
      "start_ms": 81900,
      "end_ms": 83245,
      "text": "所以我儿子叫安安，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4e5ac4f844cfdd7a_s00035",
      "start_ms": 83700,
      "end_ms": 87270,
      "text": "现在他叫铜锣湾安仔嘟图姐快呀。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4e5ac4f844cfdd7a_s00036",
      "start_ms": 87290,
      "end_ms": 91065,
      "text": "猫咪为什么想到带孩子来香港上学？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4e5ac4f844cfdd7a_s00037",
      "start_ms": 91460,
      "end_ms": 96545,
      "text": "其实我并不是想让我儿子接受香港本地的DSE考试和华侨生联考，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4e5ac4f844cfdd7a_s00038",
      "start_ms": 96960,
      "end_ms": 99555,
      "text": "我特别认可一众将IB的教育体系。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4e5ac4f844cfdd7a_s00039",
      "start_ms": 99970,
      "end_ms": 103465,
      "text": "而中国实行IB学校最多的城市就是香港，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4e5ac4f844cfdd7a_s00040",
      "start_ms": 104120,
      "end_ms": 106625,
      "text": "而且这是全球最难的一种课程体系，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4e5ac4f844cfdd7a_s00041",
      "start_ms": 106870,
      "end_ms": 108555,
      "text": "对孩子的挑战会非常大，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4e5ac4f844cfdd7a_s00042",
      "start_ms": 108970,
      "end_ms": 113735,
      "text": "他要比内地的高考要比level AP、 DSE等等都要更难。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4e5ac4f844cfdd7a_s00043",
      "start_ms": 114140,
      "end_ms": 115280,
      "text": "不仅要求会考试，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4e5ac4f844cfdd7a_s00044",
      "start_ms": 115460,
      "end_ms": 118175,
      "text": "还要学会独立做研究、写长论文。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4e5ac4f844cfdd7a_s00045",
      "start_ms": 118590,
      "end_ms": 120850,
      "text": "而且IB教育很强调尊重差异，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4e5ac4f844cfdd7a_s00046",
      "start_ms": 121090,
      "end_ms": 122325,
      "text": "主动与别人合作，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4e5ac4f844cfdd7a_s00047",
      "start_ms": 122790,
      "end_ms": 124985,
      "text": "多数人追求的根本就不是幸福，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4e5ac4f844cfdd7a_s00048",
      "start_ms": 125290,
      "end_ms": 126835,
      "text": "而是高人一等的优越感。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4e5ac4f844cfdd7a_s00049",
      "start_ms": 127350,
      "end_ms": 129815,
      "text": "我很认可IB这种很善良的教育观。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4e5ac4f844cfdd7a_s00050",
      "start_ms": 130180,
      "end_ms": 132595,
      "text": "我希望我的孩子他会主动阅读，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4e5ac4f844cfdd7a_s00051",
      "start_ms": 132890,
      "end_ms": 133990,
      "text": "会批判性思考，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4e5ac4f844cfdd7a_s00052",
      "start_ms": 134290,
      "end_ms": 136885,
      "text": "勇于表达、尊重这个丰富的世界。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4e5ac4f844cfdd7a_s00053",
      "start_ms": 137330,
      "end_ms": 140165,
      "text": "人成长的过程就是在逐渐减少偏见。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4e5ac4f844cfdd7a_s00054",
      "start_ms": 140700,
      "end_ms": 144835,
      "text": "目前内地在幼儿园和小学阶段就开始实行IB教育的很少。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4e5ac4f844cfdd7a_s00055",
      "start_ms": 145210,
      "end_ms": 147705,
      "text": "其实上海和北京的IB中学也很好。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4e5ac4f844cfdd7a_s00056",
      "start_ms": 148100,
      "end_ms": 149660,
      "text": "我之所以没有在香港买房，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4e5ac4f844cfdd7a_s00057",
      "start_ms": 150060,
      "end_ms": 152805,
      "text": "就是想着以后也许随着我儿子上中学，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4e5ac4f844cfdd7a_s00058",
      "start_ms": 153040,
      "end_ms": 154485,
      "text": "我们还会继续搬家。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4e5ac4f844cfdd7a_s00059",
      "start_ms": 155020,
      "end_ms": 156615,
      "text": "我不在任何城市下注，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4e5ac4f844cfdd7a_s00060",
      "start_ms": 156890,
      "end_ms": 159120,
      "text": "不在任何地点抱有定居思维，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4e5ac4f844cfdd7a_s00061",
      "start_ms": 159320,
      "end_ms": 161055,
      "text": "也不和任何人或物绑定，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4e5ac4f844cfdd7a_s00062",
      "start_ms": 161540,
      "end_ms": 163720,
      "text": "随时随地拥有绝对的迁徙。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4e5ac4f844cfdd7a_s00063",
      "start_ms": 163720,
      "end_ms": 165000,
      "text": "权要知道，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4e5ac4f844cfdd7a_s00064",
      "start_ms": 165000,
      "end_ms": 165520,
      "text": "这几年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4e5ac4f844cfdd7a_s00065",
      "start_ms": 165520,
      "end_ms": 166880,
      "text": "我为了寻找IB学校，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4e5ac4f844cfdd7a_s00066",
      "start_ms": 167080,
      "end_ms": 172055,
      "text": "专门考察过加拿大、芬兰、德国、美国、新西兰等等很多国家，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4e5ac4f844cfdd7a_s00067",
      "start_ms": 172320,
      "end_ms": 175510,
      "text": "但最终还是选择回到中国香港，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4e5ac4f844cfdd7a_s00068",
      "start_ms": 175510,
      "end_ms": 176335,
      "text": "很国际化，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4e5ac4f844cfdd7a_s00069",
      "start_ms": 176640,
      "end_ms": 178435,
      "text": "但他永远是我们中国的香港。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4e5ac4f844cfdd7a_s00070",
      "start_ms": 178730,
      "end_ms": 181645,
      "text": "这是一个可进可退的、很现实的城市选择，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4e5ac4f844cfdd7a_s00071",
      "start_ms": 182250,
      "end_ms": 184545,
      "text": "我对其他国家真的实在没有归属感。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4e5ac4f844cfdd7a_s00072",
      "start_ms": 185070,
      "end_ms": 186675,
      "text": "你要让我去国外旅游，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4e5ac4f844cfdd7a_s00073",
      "start_ms": 186940,
      "end_ms": 187835,
      "text": "但我非常开心，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4e5ac4f844cfdd7a_s00074",
      "start_ms": 188330,
      "end_ms": 190295,
      "text": "但真要让我长期住在那里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4e5ac4f844cfdd7a_s00075",
      "start_ms": 190730,
      "end_ms": 191755,
      "text": "想想都很孤独。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4e5ac4f844cfdd7a_s00076",
      "start_ms": 192420,
      "end_ms": 193780,
      "text": "我看到很多国外的陪读，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4e5ac4f844cfdd7a_s00077",
      "start_ms": 193780,
      "end_ms": 196565,
      "text": "父母表面看起来物质生活很丰富，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4e5ac4f844cfdd7a_s00078",
      "start_ms": 196870,
      "end_ms": 198505,
      "text": "但是内心都异常痛苦。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4e5ac4f844cfdd7a_s00079",
      "start_ms": 198900,
      "end_ms": 202025,
      "text": "因为你知道你很难融入当地的主流生活，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4e5ac4f844cfdd7a_s00080",
      "start_ms": 202640,
      "end_ms": 204975,
      "text": "而为什么做游客的时候总是快乐的？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4e5ac4f844cfdd7a_s00081",
      "start_ms": 205200,
      "end_ms": 208215,
      "text": "因为你知道你的痛苦和责任都不在这里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4e5ac4f844cfdd7a_s00082",
      "start_ms": 208560,
      "end_ms": 209435,
      "text": "置身事外，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4e5ac4f844cfdd7a_s00083",
      "start_ms": 209820,
      "end_ms": 211095,
      "text": "才能感受到幸福。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4e5ac4f844cfdd7a_s00084",
      "start_ms": 211840,
      "end_ms": 212280,
      "text": "爸爸，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4e5ac4f844cfdd7a_s00085",
      "start_ms": 212280,
      "end_ms": 213960,
      "text": "你这样好好嗯，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4e5ac4f844cfdd7a_s00086",
      "start_ms": 214300,
      "end_ms": 214965,
      "text": "好吃吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4e5ac4f844cfdd7a_s00087",
      "start_ms": 215750,
      "end_ms": 219460,
      "text": "是嗯这么大，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4e5ac4f844cfdd7a_s00088",
      "start_ms": 220220,
      "end_ms": 220945,
      "text": "你吃这么多，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4e5ac4f844cfdd7a_s00089",
      "start_ms": 222640,
      "end_ms": 223255,
      "text": "慢点吃，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4e5ac4f844cfdd7a_s00090",
      "start_ms": 225400,
      "end_ms": 227140,
      "text": "我期待安安在香港成长，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4e5ac4f844cfdd7a_s00091",
      "start_ms": 227360,
      "end_ms": 228560,
      "text": "经常跟着我往返。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4e5ac4f844cfdd7a_s00092",
      "start_ms": 228580,
      "end_ms": 231055,
      "text": "香港和北京既有中国灵魂，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4e5ac4f844cfdd7a_s00093",
      "start_ms": 231320,
      "end_ms": 232465,
      "text": "又有世界胸怀。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4e5ac4f844cfdd7a_s00094",
      "start_ms": 232920,
      "end_ms": 234115,
      "text": "香港人特别爱国，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4e5ac4f844cfdd7a_s00095",
      "start_ms": 234450,
      "end_ms": 235895,
      "text": "街头处处挂着国旗。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4e5ac4f844cfdd7a_s00096",
      "start_ms": 236300,
      "end_ms": 236880,
      "text": "在香港，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4e5ac4f844cfdd7a_s00097",
      "start_ms": 236960,
      "end_ms": 239575,
      "text": "我最喜欢的就是自己在家做油泼面吃。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4e5ac4f844cfdd7a_s00098",
      "start_ms": 240350,
      "end_ms": 241630,
      "text": "你看香港这么发达，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4e5ac4f844cfdd7a_s00099",
      "start_ms": 241810,
      "end_ms": 244210,
      "text": "怎么还是给人一种九十年代的感觉。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4e5ac4f844cfdd7a_s00100",
      "start_ms": 244790,
      "end_ms": 248690,
      "text": "其实内地普通人的生活便利性是遥遥领先的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4e5ac4f844cfdd7a_s00101",
      "start_ms": 249230,
      "end_ms": 252530,
      "text": "每一个在香港打拼的内地朋友都各有心算。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4e5ac4f844cfdd7a_s00102",
      "start_ms": 252950,
      "end_ms": 255630,
      "text": "我很佩服每一个能出去单打独斗的人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4e5ac4f844cfdd7a_s00103",
      "start_ms": 255870,
      "end_ms": 257610,
      "text": "敢想敢拼敢干，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4e5ac4f844cfdd7a_s00104",
      "start_ms": 257890,
      "end_ms": 259470,
      "text": "一个人就能活出一个队伍。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4e5ac4f844cfdd7a_s00105",
      "start_ms": 259950,
      "end_ms": 260970,
      "text": "你可以回头看，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4e5ac4f844cfdd7a_s00106",
      "start_ms": 261330,
      "end_ms": 262450,
      "text": "但不能往回走。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4e5ac4f844cfdd7a_s00107",
      "start_ms": 262810,
      "end_ms": 263230,
      "text": "朱军，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4e5ac4f844cfdd7a_s00108",
      "start_ms": 263490,
      "end_ms": 264190,
      "text": "你知道吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4e5ac4f844cfdd7a_s00109",
      "start_ms": 264410,
      "end_ms": 267070,
      "text": "我儿子到维多利亚港只要二十分钟，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4e5ac4f844cfdd7a_s00110",
      "start_ms": 267450,
      "end_ms": 269855,
      "text": "但我这一路走了三十多年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4e5ac4f844cfdd7a_s00111",
      "start_ms": 270500,
      "end_ms": 271400,
      "text": "而你相信吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4e5ac4f844cfdd7a_s00112",
      "start_ms": 271620,
      "end_ms": 273960,
      "text": "你莫名向往的那个陌生的城市，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4e5ac4f844cfdd7a_s00113",
      "start_ms": 274120,
      "end_ms": 275940,
      "text": "都是今生有羁绊的地方。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4e5ac4f844cfdd7a_s00114",
      "start_ms": 276400,
      "end_ms": 279220,
      "text": "那种心底的拉扯从不是偶然，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4e5ac4f844cfdd7a_s00115",
      "start_ms": 279600,
      "end_ms": 282640,
      "text": "而是上天在指引你去完成未尽的缘分。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4e5ac4f844cfdd7a_s00116",
      "start_ms": 283160,
      "end_ms": 285400,
      "text": "那里或许有你要重逢的人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4e5ac4f844cfdd7a_s00117",
      "start_ms": 285640,
      "end_ms": 287300,
      "text": "又或许有属于你的机会。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4e5ac4f844cfdd7a_s00118",
      "start_ms": 287680,
      "end_ms": 289320,
      "text": "当你站在那片土地上时，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4e5ac4f844cfdd7a_s00119",
      "start_ms": 289320,
      "end_ms": 290300,
      "text": "你才会明白，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4e5ac4f844cfdd7a_s00120",
      "start_ms": 290640,
      "end_ms": 293160,
      "text": "所有的奔赴都是命中注定的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4e5ac4f844cfdd7a_s00121",
      "start_ms": 293340,
      "end_ms": 294300,
      "text": "久别重逢，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4e5ac4f844cfdd7a_s00122",
      "start_ms": 294900,
      "end_ms": 295500,
      "text": "祝福你，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4e5ac4f844cfdd7a_s00123",
      "start_ms": 295680,
      "end_ms": 297360,
      "text": "别再过你应该过的人生。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4e5ac4f844cfdd7a_s00124",
      "start_ms": 297660,
      "end_ms": 299695,
      "text": "去过你想过的人生。"
    }
  ],
